d singles, including \"Love Is the Message\", \"Sexy\" and \"K-Jee\". The band's music was featured in a number of films and television shows, and their influence can be heard in the work of numerous artists in the funk and disco genres.\r\n\r\nDespite a number of lineup changes over the years, MFSB continued to perform and record throughout the 1980s and 1990s. The band's legacy as one of the pioneers of the Philadelphia soul sound continues to be felt today, and their music remains beloved by fans of funk and R&B.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:3452","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":258403,"name":"The Philly Sound"},{"id":1035298,"name":"The Family (8)"}],"groups":null,"members":[{"active":false,"id":20559,"name":"Dexter Wansel"},{"active":true,"id":62811,"name":"Reggie Lucas"},{"active":false,"id":95705,"name":"Leon Huff"},{"active":true,"id":119192,"name":"Keith Benson"},{"active":true,"id":125117,"name":"Ron Kersey"},{"active":false,"id":128026,"name":"Norman Harris"},{"active":true,"id":135848,"name":"Anthony Jackson"},{"active":false,"id":160667,"name":"Earl Young"},{"active":false,"id":163232,"name":"Ron Baker"},{"active":false,"id":164262,"name":"Thom Bell"},{"active":false,"id":170322,"name":"Vincent Montana, Jr."},{"active":true,"id":211615,"name":"Charles Collins"},{"active":false,"id":213280,"name":"Larry Gold"},{"active":true,"id":221255,"name":"Victor Carstarphen"},{"active":false,"id":226008,"name":"Quinton Joseph"},{"active":false,"id":256144,"name":"Larry Washington"},{"active":false,"id":293076,"name":"Roland Chambers"},{"active":true,"id":295135,"name":"Carla Benson"},{"active":true,"id":315688,"name":"Harold \"Ivory\" Williams"},{"active":true,"id":316036,"name":"Don Renaldo"},{"active":true,"id":343944,"name":"John Ingram"},{"active":true,"id":347509,"name":"Norman Fearrington"},{"active":false,"id":384596,"name":"John Davis (5)"},{"active":false,"id":392878,"name":"Karl Chambers"},{"active":true,"id":401276,"name":"TJ Tindall"},{"act